orrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-02-25","finding":"Responsibilities of Caregivers- Supervision of Children: Upon arrival, the caregiver in the infant room was observed sitting in a chair outside of the room while supervising infants. Three infants were observed to be awake and walking around. There were no other caregivers present in the room.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026481896","violation_type_title":"Responsibilities of Caregivers - Supervision of Children (26 TAC §746.1203(4))","topic_label":"Supervision & ratios"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1121158-i20220210-v5","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-4135-b","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1121158-i20220210","date":"2022-02-10","original_code":"746.4135(b)","severity":"medium","severity_label":"Medium risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Corrected at inspection","finding":"Children's Products- Annual Certification: The Children's products safety certificate was last completed 2/19/2020    NOTE: Corrected at inspection, the CPSC was completed during the inspection.","topic":"staffing","source_record_id":"1026441908","violation_type_title":"Children's Products- Annual Certification (26 TAC §746.4135(b))","topic_label":"Staff qualifications & clearances"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1121158-i20220210-v6","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-3701-8","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1121158-i20220210","date":"2022-02-10","original_code":"746.3701(8)","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-02-25","finding":"Safety - Bodies of Water Inaccessible to Children: A broken toy on the playground was observed to be collecting water.","topic":"safety","source_record_id":"1026441909","violation_type_title":"Safety - Bodies of Water Inaccessible to Children (26 TAC §746.3701(8))","topic_label":"Safety hazards"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1121158-i20220210-v7","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-3407","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1121158-i20220210","date":"2022-02-10","original_code":"746.3